WEBVTT

00:09:59.470 --> 00:10:02.848
And so it remains very vulnerable
to another disaster.

00:10:02.890 --> 00:10:07.394
So my PAC is endorsing
just as one example,

00:10:07.436 --> 00:10:10.939
a young progressive Democrat,
happens to be very handsome,

00:10:10.981 --> 00:10:12.232
named Luke Warford,

00:10:12.274 --> 00:10:13.859
he's 33 years old,

00:10:13.859 --> 00:10:17.696
he’s not afraid to hold the oil and gas
industry accountable --

00:10:17.738 --> 00:10:21.867
not to build a career
but to really make a difference.

00:10:21.909 --> 00:10:23.827
And if he's elected,

00:10:23.869 --> 00:10:27.247
it’s going to change
how the Commission does its job.

00:10:27.247 --> 00:10:30.709
And believe me, Texans
and the planet will be safer.